### C.3. `frame-sequence-writer` — Escritor de secuencia PNG a disco

| Campo | Detalle |
|---|---|
| **Propósito** | Recibir Blobs de frames y persistirlos ordenados `frame_000001.png`. |
| **Uso** | Alimenta a ffmpeg. |
| **Dependencias** | `node:fs/promises`, `node:path` |

```ts
// server/lib/frame-sequence-writer.ts

import fs from 'node:fs/promises';
import path from 'node:path';

export class FrameSequenceWriter {
  private readonly dir: string;
  private frameIndex = 0;

  constructor(outputDir: string) {
    this.dir = outputDir;
  }

  async ensureDir(): Promise<void> {
    await fs.mkdir(this.dir, { recursive: true });
  }

  async write(frameBuffer: Buffer): Promise<string> {
    const name = `frame_${String(this.frameIndex).padStart(6, '0')}.png`;
    const full = path.join(this.dir, name);
    await fs.writeFile(full, frameBuffer);
    this.frameIndex++;
    return full;
  }

  get count(): number {
    return this.frameIndex;
  }
}
```

