## D. IA / STORYBOARD

### D.1. `storyboard-contract` — Contratos Zod

| Campo | Detalle |
|---|---|
| **Propósito** | Validar storyboards (sustituto pragmático de Q-Omega en MVP). |
| **Uso** | Toda salida de IA pasa por aquí antes de entrar al estado. |
| **Dependencias** | `zod`, `scene-types` |

```ts
// src/storyboard/storyboard-contract.ts

import { z } from 'zod';
import { SCENE_KINDS, CAMERA_MOVES, PALETTE_IDS } from '../core/scene-types';

export const SceneSchema = z.object({
  startSec: z.number().min(0),
  endSec: z.number().positive(),
  kind: z.enum(SCENE_KINDS as [string, ...string[]]),
  palette: z.enum(PALETTE_IDS as [string, ...string[]]),
  intensity: z.number().min(0).max(1),
  camera: z.enum(CAMERA_MOVES as [string, ...string[]]),
  label: z.string().min(1).max(40),
}).refine((s) => s.endSec > s.startSec, { message: 'endSec debe ser > startSec' });

export const StoryboardSchema = z.array(SceneSchema).min(1).max(20);

export type StoryboardDTO = z.infer<typeof StoryboardSchema>;
```

